---
import Button from "../shared/Button.astro";
import Container from "../shared/Container.astro";
import Paragraph from "../shared/Paragraph.astro";
---

<section id="cta" class="pb-20">
  <Container>
    <div class="w-full relative py-8 md:py-10 px-6 md:px-8 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-gray-100 to-gray-200 dark:from-gray-900">
      <div class="absolute right-0 top-0 h-full w-full flex justify-end">
        <div class="w-28 h-28 overflow-auto flex rounded-xl relative blur-2xl">
          <span class="absolute w-16 h-16 -top-1 -right-1 bg-green-500 rounded-md rotate-45"></span>
          <span class="absolute w-16 h-16 -bottom-1 -right-1 bg-[#FCDC58] rounded-md rotate-45"></span>
          <span class="absolute w-16 h-16 -bottom-1 -left-1 bg-primary rounded-md rotate-45"></span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="absolute left-0 bottom-0 h-full w-full flex items-end">
        <div class="w-28 h-28 overflow-auto flex rounded-xl relative blur-2xl">
          <span class="absolute w-16 h-16 -top-1 -right-1 bg-green-500 rounded-md rotate-45"></span>
          <span class="absolute w-16 h-16 -bottom-1 -right-1 bg-[#FCDC58] rounded-md rotate-45"></span>
          <span class="absolute w-16 h-16 -bottom-1 -left-1 bg-primary rounded-md rotate-45"></span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mx-auto text-center max-w-xl md:max-w-2xl relative">
        <h1 class="text-3xl/tight sm:text-4xl/tight md:text-5xl/tight font-bold text-heading-1">
          Distribuidores Exclusivos de <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-600 from-20% via-primary via-30% to-green-600">UNIKA</span> en Costa Rica
        </h1>
        <Paragraph className={"pt-10"}>
          Somos representantes oficiales de UNIKA, la nanoplastia de última generación de Agilie Cosméticos. Brindamos atención personalizada, asesoría profesional y productos 100% originales. Escríbenos para realizar tu pedido.
        </Paragraph>
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-md sm:max-w-xl pt-10">
          <a href="https://wa.me/50688900721?text=Me%20interesa%20la%20nanoplastia%20UNIKA" 
             target="_blank" 
             rel="noopener noreferrer"
             class="inline-block px-8 py-4 text-white font-semibold bg-primary rounded-2xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl hover:bg-green-700 transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out">
            Comprar
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>

